    "$t": "是按怎án-ne生 - 聽你leh pûn雞胿"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《<span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">聽你leh pûn雞胿</span>》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">洪明道</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">(作者是作家、醫生)</span></span></span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgMvpJ5BtnxUuuP-NrWrYmxr1zVTAnU9oHyil8md6k_tvDJ80ybmwSDHiesU-S3kV06Kolaq7gzcicmCiXDPsbvLaNV4oT0faRq_ECyg-F6iTKrtYQqIOKRXNgg2VNMoTEeibPosPdfxgv9rOpkgiNce8UDxcQmni2EYtlOLL6V5EUuIk996k-eRK_7BZiA\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgMvpJ5BtnxUuuP-NrWrYmxr1zVTAnU9oHyil8md6k_tvDJ80ybmwSDHiesU-S3kV06Kolaq7gzcicmCiXDPsbvLaNV4oT0faRq_ECyg-F6iTKrtYQqIOKRXNgg2VNMoTEeibPosPdfxgv9rOpkgiNce8UDxcQmni2EYtlOLL6V5EUuIk996k-eRK_7BZiA=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjYVj5FDroeDo0lT7SHxdPQkOeheTF6doH7ydJi-7hAOHCNR9io-QVUGJojlqR7Fh0nym23AoLxEU34fHa86xty1Mb4aU2atZsIGBYcVq3ictzLISTPGFMGOLrkRncAiiuDdYohm2qsiS3xtsbvc7ryVk1lZ3zEEO8G54BC1I3wKqmHo2AbR69pUJ4NXktt\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjYVj5FDroeDo0lT7SHxdPQkOeheTF6doH7ydJi-7hAOHCNR9io-QVUGJojlqR7Fh0nym23AoLxEU34fHa86xty1Mb4aU2atZsIGBYcVq3ictzLISTPGFMGOLrkRncAiiuDdYohm2qsiS3xtsbvc7ryVk1lZ3zEEO8G54BC1I3wKqmHo2AbR69pUJ4NXktt=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgPBw82_o4doGWpF9Eab7ERdmJqJDCxNpUlLUjshvu_mJilUbJGbndQvnPDspwYbNqLA2kcB2o2fFfPIJ69JRnagqKZHuV4-RWZMJYVyRisttEIDFBA5s5N0q8cvXZulds8y0vpqvV41f3qrpFuLIq4IAkejoht8iNfXCdJSM_JvOnCvWrJkBXxng6_uKi\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgPBw82_o4doGWpF9Eab7ERdmJqJDCxNpUlLUjshvu_mJilUbJGbndQvnPDspwYbNqLA2kcB2o2fFfPIJ69JRnagqKZHuV4-RWZMJYVyRisttEIDFBA5s5N0q8cvXZulds8y0vpqvV41f3qrpFuLIq4IAkejoht8iNfXCdJSM_JvOnCvWrJkBXxng6_uKi=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">又koh是拜三暗時。Tsit工m̄是節日、無beh拜拜，m̄-koh在阿仁來講是大日子。省公路邊hit塊停車場，擔仔位排kah ti̋nn-tīnn-tīnn，商展koh來--looh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿爸、阿母各人騎一台oo-tóo-bái，載阿仁kah芯--a。到hia tsiah 6點外，車位已經tsiânn歹揣--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">拄入--去，阿仁看人leh射鏢，看kah m̄知thang行。頭家用mòo-tà灌雞胿仔，khe̍h一枝管仔，雞胿仔long--起-去，無一時仔隨就灌飽--ah。雞胿仔圓輾輾，頭家一粒一粒kā縛踮枋仔頂面。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">布尪仔、塑膠仔車，tshit-thô-mih仔排規tsuā，邊--a koh有一kuānn ē浮ê氣球，做成bàng-gà角色hit型--ê。M̄-koh，tse阿仁lóng無beh愛，伊兩蕊目睭kan-na leh看雞胿仔。Hit台灌風ê機器，一下仔就灌一粒，thài ē tsiah厲害。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「阿弟仔，無，tsit包hōo--你--lah。」頭家看伊tsîn kah目睭lóng beh吐--出-來，就送伊一包雞胿仔，五花十色，大粒細粒總有。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿爸ē歹勢ê款，tu一張銀票hōo頭家，講beh sńg一局。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「來，看hōo好--őo，lín阿爸khah早做兵，tuānn銃偌準--leh。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿爸飛鏢攑--起-來，目睭kheh一蕊，手sut--一-下tsiânn有pān。M̄-koh，鏢kan-na射著下底he phoo-lé-lóng，雞胿仔連huê to無huê--著。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「頭一改是leh挽筋，tsit-má tsiah正經beh來。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tńg--來了後，阿仁隨kā雞胿仔提來pûn。伊想beh pûn一粒上大粒--ê出--來，喙phué ná膨鼠脹大大。伊出力pûn，喙phué酸kah，pûn kah一屑仔khuì to pûn bē入--去tsiah thang煞。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿仁ē-hiáu pûn，bē-hiáu縛。伊手kā雞胿仔tēnn--leh，beh去展hōo芯--a看。芯--a tńg--來就leh顧hit隻布尪仔，佳哉，阿爸尾--à iáu有射著mi̍h件。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行--leh行--leh，阿仁踢著桌跤，手無細膩去hōo放--去。一港風uì雞胿仔ê喙漏--出-來，kā雞胿仔sak leh走。就án-ne，雞胿仔飛--起-來--ah。雞胿仔飛有夠遠koh有夠緊，飛beh到天pông hia，落尾踮客廳se̍h兩輾tsiah消風--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Honnh！臭moo-moo，lóng tú-tsiah牛排ê味。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">※　&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※　&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">看著稻仔一湧一湧，草仔tuè leh幌，樹影tuè leh搖，lán就知影，起風--ah。風uì佗位來，伊ē kā lán tshuā uì佗位去？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán蹛ê地球，sì-kè lóng有空氣，只是lán看無mā摸無。Tsit沿空氣，號做「大氣層」（tāi-khì-tsân，atmosphere）。空氣內底「氮氣」（tām-khì，nitrogen）上濟，koh來是「sàng-sòo」（oxygen）。Sàng-sòo mā號做「氧氣」（ióng-khì），濟濟生物tio̍h-ài有sàng-sòo呼吸，無bē活--得。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">空氣無色mā無味，m̄-koh，in leh流動ê時，lán就ē覺察--著，tse就是風。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Khah早ê人就知影thang用工具來起風。粟仔leh收成人工去割，割hōo規堆。M̄-koh，he內底有ê是phànn粟仔，稻仔殼脯脯，內底無米。粟仔tsiânn千粒，若叫人去揀粟仔，m̄知beh揀kah tang時。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit項khang-khuè，就用風鼓來處理。人kā風鼓pháng hōo行，kā空氣sak--出-去，產生風。Khah輕ê phànn粟仔，hōo風吹uì邊--a去。Lak--落-來--ê，就是khah重ê米粟。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">技術愈來愈進步，風鼓尾--à改用mòo-tà，就免人用手pháng。用mòo-tà來起風ê機械tsiânn濟，飼魚仔leh用ê噴料桶、掃葉仔ê風機，koh有吹頭毛ê吹風機，lóng用tsit款原理。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">台灣是風tsiânn透ê所在。寒--人吹東北風，熱--人透南風，風向tuè四季leh變，lán kā叫做季風。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">古早人就知影利用季風駛船仔。福建tsia ê人特別gâu做船仔，tsit款船風帆tsiânn大phiāng，生做bē輸魚翼。台灣西部燒ê王船，就是做tsit款船ê形。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán若tńg去三、四百冬前，tī東南亞海面上，ē看著bē少tsit款船仔。寒--人ē-tàng食東北風去南洋、馬六甲（Melaka），熱--人ē-tàng食南風去Okinawa、日本。有ê是駛船做貿易，有ê是做海賊。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">台南五條港khah早是交易ê港口，船tio̍h-ài食風tsiah ē行。Hia有一間風神廟，就是beh拜hōo風調雨順，thang hōo駛船--ê平安。西部台灣人ê先人，凡勢有坐tsit款船來--ê。風kā lán ê祖先tshuā來台灣。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tann khah無人leh駛帆船--ah。Tsit-má，lán用tsit款風leh發電。Lán若坐火車過苗栗，ē看著一枝一枝風機，插tī海邊仔，好親像大種人ê電風。風吹--過-來，kā風車葉（ia̍p）吹hōo行，發電機tsiah-koh kā轉換做電力。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh，風機tshāi陸地，聲音ē影響著人kah附近ê動物。扇葉ê影直直se̍h，人看著ē眩。風機kā tshāi tī海--裡，khah bē有tsit款問題。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是講，天頂to無mòo-tà koh，是按怎ē有風--leh？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgWP4Cz0eiJ3TfebEHCLjSoDbmGrHmQiYj5SaLOdm01GYmAc159RMymzLitY-RcZbwnFS3SfwjDsm3Zq6nfL7OXCi6OCG_FsrwptZm8ul_aHSJuI3rmgzNKy4FrDeE8KGJJS3lCFcMcHRz_4PBQqfSoWid577_axFTV0t02DVwp9gs-UAdx0IJWCLlBmaQN\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"395\" data-original-width=\"589\" height=\"430\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgWP4Cz0eiJ3TfebEHCLjSoDbmGrHmQiYj5SaLOdm01GYmAc159RMymzLitY-RcZbwnFS3SfwjDsm3Zq6nfL7OXCi6OCG_FsrwptZm8ul_aHSJuI3rmgzNKy4FrDeE8KGJJS3lCFcMcHRz_4PBQqfSoWid577_axFTV0t02DVwp9gs-UAdx0IJWCLlBmaQN=w640-h430\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><br /></span></div><div><br /></div></div><div><div>答案：</div><div>Lán地球頂面ê空氣，有ê所在照著日，溫度khah kuân，有ê khah無，溫度khah低。溫度無仝，氣壓就ē無仝，空氣自然uì氣壓kuân ê所在，走去到氣壓低ê所在。頂面lán就有講--著，空氣leh行就ē有風。Lán台灣邊--a是熱帶ê海洋，koh-khah gâu起大風雨。Tsit款風雨若絞做伙，強度超過一个標準，lán就kā號做風颱。</div></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">配合課綱</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">國小自然：翰林版三上單元3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">核心素養指標：自-E-1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">學習內容：INd-II-4, INg-II-1</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">專欄簡介</span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></div><div>【是按怎án-ne生】是hōo囡仔看ê科學故事，逐個月一篇。頭先寫囡仔生活中ē拄--著、牽連著科學ê代誌，suà--來解sueh故事內底ê原理。Lán ē照台語實驗小學高雄市路竹區北嶺小學ê課程來行，難度khah深--一-點-仔，加一寡科學史、台灣史。Ē-tàng準做是補充教材，一般學生仔mā ē讀--得。</div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 381期，2025年12月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><br /></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;\"></p></div></div></span></div></span></div></div></div></span></div></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">  </span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。</span></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></span></div></div></div></span></div></h2></span></div></span></div>"
